---
import Headline from "../../shared/Headline.astro";
import BioBlock from "../BioBlock/BioBlock.astro";
---

<section aria-labelledby="bio">
  <Headline id="bio">Frontend developer. Product builder.</Headline>

  <BioBlock>
    <p>
      Hi, I’m David. I build frontend software for startups and nimble teams.
    </p>
  </BioBlock>

  <BioBlock>
    For over six years, I’ve worked on early-stage products where I take rough
    concepts and turn them into fast, responsive web applications. I do my best
    work in small teams with short feedback loops, where everyone cares about
    how the product actually feels to use. I care most about the details users
    feel but rarely notice: layouts that hold up, pages that load fast, and
    complex workflows that feel simple.
  </BioBlock>

  <BioBlock>
    My day-to-day focus is building interfaces with React, Next.js, and modern
    CSS, but I’m pragmatic about stack choices. If native browser features solve
    a problem better, I’ll reach for those instead. On the backend, I’ve built
    services with Node, Express, PostgreSQL, and MongoDB, along with some
    C#/.NET work.
  </BioBlock>

  <BioBlock>
    My path into development wasn’t traditional. Before writing code full-time,
    I split my time between IT support and playing music professionally,
    including five years as a full-time musician. Support taught me to
    troubleshoot calmly and methodically. Music gave me the creative itch that
    pulled me from fixing things to building them.
  </BioBlock>

  <BioBlock>
    Offline, I’m usually reading, outside, or playing with my golden retriever.
    Mostly the last one. He insists.
  </BioBlock>
</section>

